<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOUTH AFRICAN WATCDOG STILL MULLING CEMENT MERGER.</title>
<headline>SOUTH AFRICAN WATCDOG STILL MULLING CEMENT MERGER.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alpha Ltd and Murray and Roberts Holdings Ltd, owner of Blue Circle, said on Friday that the Competition Board had yet to complete its investigation into the planned merger of their cement operations.</p>
<p>&quot;On receipt of a favourable ruling from the Competition Board, a due diligence exercise will be undertaken, after which Alpha and M&amp;R board approvals will be sought,&quot; the companies said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
